# Who gets asked to review changes. Approval is only required once
# "Require review from Code Owners" is on in the main branch ruleset.
# The team needs write access to this repo, or GitHub ignores its lines.
#
# GitHub uses the LAST matching line for each file, so keep the default
# first and the specific rules after it.

# Default: everything, including README.md.
*              @NR-AI-Delivery/nr-ai-delivery-team

# What gets installed, and the repo's own guardrails (this file, CI, the
# PR template). Same team today; listed explicitly so these stay protected
# if the default above is later widened to a bigger group.
/Brewfile      @NR-AI-Delivery/nr-ai-delivery-team
/bootstrap.sh  @NR-AI-Delivery/nr-ai-delivery-team
/.pre-commit-config.yaml  @NR-AI-Delivery/nr-ai-delivery-team
/.github/      @NR-AI-Delivery/nr-ai-delivery-team
